      "filename": "Candi Selogriyo Hindu Temple of Java A 2013.jpg",
      "title": "File:Candi Selogriyo Hindu Temple of Java A 2013.jpg",
      "url": "https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/0/01/Candi_Selogriyo_Hindu_Temple_of_Java_A_2013.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original",
